  "chapter": "NL04",
  "title": "欧拉公式与复指数",
  "src": {
    "file": "notebook/math/survey/p4-complex.tex",
    "sha256": "sha256:448ff3c6af38ff4ed96394fa55217375f859fe35ecad4b3592c77907b51339c1"
  },
  "notebook_commit": "19f0871c3d49152874f38c4d1c0f0ad83d9a7896",
  "notebook_dirty": false,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "NL04.3:body.s01",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "是什么",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "$\\exp(a+bi)=e^{a}(\\cos b+i\\sin b)$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL04.3:body.s02",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "为什么需要",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "它是「旋转」的解析表达：单位圆上的 $\\exp(i\\theta)$ 就是转动 $\\theta$；\nDFT 的旋转因子、特征函数的 $e^{itX}$、四元数的半角公式，都是它的变体。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL04.3:body.s03",
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "关键结论",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "它与矩阵指数 $\\exp(A)$ **只在 $1\\times1$ 时重合**。成立条件：$b$ 为实数；\n相位按模 $2\\pi$ 有意义。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL04.3:body.s04",
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "判据",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "无（恒等式本身）；`expm.hpp`明确区分两者（N10）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL04.3:body.s05",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "前置",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "C1。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL04.3:body.s06",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "常见误解",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "以为 $\\exp(A)$ 可以先对元素取 $\\exp$。见 N10；两者的「指数」含义不同：\n一个是标量函数，一个是幂级数的矩阵和。"
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "kind": "library-know",
    "surveyId": "C3",
    "status": "已实现：core/complex.hpp、linalg/expm.hpp 对照",
    "section": "复分析：多值性不是缺陷，是定义的一部分"
  }
}
